-08","2026-09"],"values":[23.41921,32.06484,30.35304,36.69735,46.97089,48.77468,48.9826,49.1671,45.91507],"anomaly":[-0.19995,3.93943,-4.71783,-3.52487,2.026,1.71255,0.79575,0.92683,-0.03297]},"id":"t2m_max","label":"Air temperature (2 m, monthly mean of daily max)","label_ar":"الحرارة العظمى (متر 2)","unit":"°C","description":"Afternoon heat: the monthly mean of each day's maximum.","primary":false,"source":{"short_name":"M2TMNXSLV","version":"5.12.4","variable":"T2MMAX","daac":"GES DISC","doi":"10.5067/AP1B0BA5PD2K","access":"power_fallback","fallback_note":"NASA POWER T2M_MAX (MERRA-2 values served by POWER)","fallback_source":"MERRA-2 via NASA POWER"},"n_cells":9,"has_map":true}],"limitations":["MERRA-2 is a model (reanalysis), not a thermometer network. Changes in the satellite observations it assimilates can create artificial jumps. We therefore also show MODIS land surface temperature, an independent satellite measurement.","Land surface temperature is the temperature of the ground, not the air you feel; it responds more strongly to sunshine, soil moisture and urban surfaces.","The MERRA-2 grid is coarse (about 50 x 60 km); Kuwait City metro covers only a fraction of one cell, so governorate-level results from MERRA-2 are nearly identical to the national one.","25 years is short for climate trends. We report 95% confidence intervals and an autocorrelation-corrected test, but a single very hot or cool year still moves the slope.","The global comparison uses GISTEMP, which blends land and sea surface temperature; Kuwait's figure is a land-only 2 m air temperature. Land warms faster than oceans everywhere, so part of the ratio is expected."],"limitations_ar":["MERRA-2 نموذج إعادة تحليل وليس شبكة مقاييس حرارة؛ قد تُحدث تغييرات الأرصاد المُدمجة فيه قفزات مصطنعة، لذلك نعرض أيضاً حرارة سطح الأرض من MODIS كقياس مستقل.","حرارة سطح الأرض هي حرارة التربة لا الهواء الذي تشعر به.","شبكة MERRA-2 خشنة (نحو 50×60 كم)، لذا نتائج المحافظات تقارب النتيجة الوطنية.","25 سنة فترة قصيرة لاتجاهات المناخ؛ نعرض فواصل الثقة 95%.","المقارنة العالمية تستخدم GISTEMP الذي يمزج اليابسة والمحيطات؛ اليابسة تسخن أسرع من المحيطات في كل مكان."],"comparison":{"global":{"source":"NASA GISS GISTEMP v4, GLB.Ts+dSST.csv (land-ocean, annual J-D)","url":"https://data.giss.nasa.gov/gistemp/tabledata_v4/GLB.Ts+dSST.csv","note":"Global anomalies re-baselined to 2001-2010 to match Kuwait.","years":[2001,2002,2003,2004,2005,2006,2007,2008,2009,2010,2011,2012,2013,2014,2015,2016,2017,2018,2019,2020,2021,2022,2023,2024,2025],"anomaly":[-0.09,0.01,-0.01,-0.09,0.06,0.02,0.04,-0.08,0.04,0.1,-0.01,0.02,0.05,0.13,0.28,0.39,0.29,0.23,0.36,0.39,0.23,0.27,0.55,0.66,0.57],"trend":{"n":25,"slope_per_year":0.02513157894736842,"slope_per_decade":0.2513157894736842,"ci95_per_decade":[0.18666666666666668,0.3181818181818181],"intercept":-50.489868421052634,"total_change":0.6031578947368421,"pct_change_vs_baseline":null,"p_value":4.916191738146836e-07,"z":5.029555115766396,"tau":0.72,"test":"Mann-Kendall (Hamed-Rao) + Sen's slope","verdict":"Significant increase","significant":true},"kuwait_slope_per_decade":0.5211173809523809,"ratio_kuwait_to_global":2.07}},"verdict":{"headline":"Significant increase","headline_ar":"ارتفاع معنوي","stamp":"CASE CLOSED","what":"Air temperature (°C)","where":"Jahra","how_much":"+0.52 °C per decade (95% CI +0.28 to +0.72 °C); +1.25 °C in total over 2001-2025.","significant":"Yes. Mann-Kendall test with autocorrelation correction, p < 0.001, 25 annual values. The 95% confidence interval excludes zero.","what_ar":"درجة حرارة الهواء","where_ar":"الجهراء","how_much_ar":"+0.52 °C لكل عقد (فاصل ثقة 95%: +0.28 إلى +0.72 °C)؛ إجمالي +1.25 °C خلال 2001-2025.","text":"Air temperature in Jahra shows a statistically significant increase of +0.52 °C per decade since 2001 (p < 0.001). That adds up to +1.25 °C over 25 years. The world warmed +0.25 °C per decade over the same years (GISTEMP v4), so Jahra warmed about 2.1 times as fast as the global average.","text_ar":"يُظهر درجة حرارة الهواء في الجهراء ارتفاعًا ذا دلالة إحصائية بمقدار +0.52 °C لكل عقد منذ 2001 (p < 0.001). أي ما يعادل +1.25 °C خلال 25 سنة. سخن العالم بمقدار +0.25 °م لكل عقد في نفس الفترة (GISTEMP v4)، أي أن الجهراء سخنت نحو 2.1 أضعاف المعدل العالمي."},"evidence":["Air temperature (2 m, monthly mean): MERRA-2 via NASA POWER (FALLBACK, standing in for M2TMNXSLV T2M while Earthdata access is unavailable).","Air temperature (2 m, monthly mean of daily max): MERRA-2 via NASA POWER (FALLBACK, standing in for M2TMNXSLV T2MMAX while Earthdata access is unavailable).","Area-weighted regional mean, monthly anomalies vs 2001-2010, annual means 2001-2025.","Trend: Mann-Kendall test with Hamed-Rao autocorrelation correction; magnitude: Sen's slope with 95% confidence interval (Theil-Sen). Seasonal Kendall on monthly anomalies as a check.","Map: per-cell Mann-Kendall + Sen's slope, Benjamini-Hochberg FDR at q = 0.05; only FDR-significant cells are drawn solid."]}